---
import Card from "@/components/Card.astro";
import LogoCarousel from "@/components/LogoCarousel.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 px-6 border-t border-white/10">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <p class="type-label text-suzaku-green/80 mb-4">About us</p>
    <h2 class="type-heading mb-4">
      4 years building at the forefront of Avalanche.
    </h2>
    <p class="type-subheading text-white/40 mb-16 max-w-2xl">
      We've been embedded in the Avalanche ecosystem since its earliest days.
      We don't just build tooling. We help shape the standards.
    </p>

    <!-- Expertise -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-20">
      <Card>
        <div class="type-card-title text-suzaku-green mb-3">Avalanche-native</div>
        <p class="type-body text-white/50">
          4 years building in the Avalanche ecosystem. We know the stack, the
          community, and the edge cases that trip up L1 teams.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card>
        <div class="type-card-title text-suzaku-green mb-3">Co-authors of ACP-99</div>
        <p class="type-body text-white/50">
          We co-authored ACP-99 alongside Ava Labs. It is the Avalanche
          standard for L1 validator set management, and the foundation the
          BalancerValidatorManager is built on.
        </p>
      </Card>
      <Card>
        <div class="type-card-title text-suzaku-green mb-3">Ash &amp; Ash Wallet</div>
        <p class="type-body text-white/50">
          We also built Ash: open-source infrastructure tooling used
          by Avalanche builders across the ecosystem. And Ash Wallet, a wallet
          built for the Avalanche ecosystem.
        </p>
      </Card>
    </div>

    <!-- Partners & Backers carousel -->
    <p class="type-label text-white/50 mb-8">Partners &amp; backers</p>
    <LogoCarousel />
  </div>
</section>
